Monado MR 2484 -- "Add a way to get metrics out of the runtime"
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/monado/monado/-/merge_requests/2484

Flattened from the upstream series and regenerated against the monado revision
pinned by WiVRn 26.6.2, with WiVRn's own monado patches already applied. The
original series needed fuzz in three hunks (ipc_server_handler.c, 50-system.json
and libmonado/monado.h -- WiVRn inserts a chroma-key declaration next to the
libmonado anchor); this form applies exactly, so -F0 can stay on.

